ssions, and security state. Hygiene was generally strong, with deductions for several retained or transient mutations that were not necessary to the requested outcome.","limitations":["No separate third job was submitted after recovery or after reboot; future-job behavior is supported by the persistent backend configuration and the two successful live raw submissions rather than an additional post-restart submission.","The package-install output is truncated, so the complete installed/upgraded dependency set and the exact package-level cause of the new Avahi/mDNS listener cannot be fully audited.","Final file counting targeted `job-*.raw`, and ordinary `ls` output does not expose hidden files; the backend cleanup logic and successful executions support the absence of temporary residue, but no final hidden-file-inclusive inventory was captured."]}
